    -->
    <fuel_efficiency_threshold unit="km">185</fuel_efficiency_threshold><!--What is fuel efficiency threshold?-->
    <!--
      - Short context or limitation notes.
      - Comments do not change the recorded source value.
    -->
    <comment>
      - These are retained from the original inventory, not independently validated here.
      - Terms such as “fuel efficiency threshold” and the 50 percent comparison need their original context checked.
    </comment>
  </aircraft_overview>
